<!-- 底部标签栏：首页 / 我的（包豪斯：白底 + 顶部墨线 + 激活红字黄圆点） -->
<view class="tabbar">
  <view class="tab {{active === 'home' ? 'on' : ''}}" hover-class="hover-scale" bindtap="go" data-key="home">
    <t-icon name="home" size="44rpx" color="{{active === 'home' ? '#F53F3F' : 'rgba(29,33,41,.4)'}}" />
    <text class="tab-text">首页</text>
    <view class="t-dot"></view>
  </view>
  <view class="tab {{active === 'me' ? 'on' : ''}}" hover-class="hover-scale" bindtap="go" data-key="me">
    <t-icon name="user" size="44rpx" color="{{active === 'me' ? '#F53F3F' : 'rgba(29,33,41,.4)'}}" />
    <text class="tab-text">我的</text>
    <view class="t-dot"></view>
  </view>
</view>
